msgid "External access: Tinfoil/CyberFoil only"
msgstr "外部访问：仅限 Tinfoil/CyberFoil"

#: app/templates/settings.html:703
msgid "If enabled, requests from external/public IP addresses are allowed only for Tinfoil/CyberFoil shop clients (detected by the Tinfoil header set and/or matching <code>User-Agent</code>). Private/local network access is unchanged."
msgstr "启用后，来自外部/公网 IP 地址的请求仅允许 Tinfoil/CyberFoil 商店客户端（通过 Tinfoil 请求头集合和/或匹配的 <code>User-Agent</code> 检测）。私有/本地网络访问不受影响。"

