msgid "Serve encrypted and compressed shop, so that only Tinfoil clients can access the content. <strong>Strongly suggested to enable it for security</strong>."
msgstr "提供加密并压缩的商店，仅 Tinfoil 客户端可访问内容。<strong>出于安全考虑，强烈建议启用</strong>。"

