msgid "Fast transfer mode"
msgstr "快速传输模式"

#: app/templates/settings.html:722
msgid "Prioritize throughput by skipping per-chunk transfer tracking. Activity live byte counters and exact transfer byte accounting may be less precise."
msgstr "跳过逐块传输统计以优先保证吞吐量。活动记录中的实时字节计数和精确传输字节统计可能不够准确。"

